{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "What is the objective of this production plan — should I maximize total profit (revenue minus raw material cost minus operating costs), or is there another goal such as maximizing total output or minimizing cost?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the optimization objective, presenting alternatives within one coherent question."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "The \"Operating Costs at Full Capacity\" column gives a cost for each machine — is this a fixed cost incurred whenever the machine is used at all (regardless of how many hours), or is it a variable cost that scales proportionally with the fraction of the machine's hours actually used?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding the nature of the operating costs (fixed vs. variable)."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Is there a demand limit on how many units of each product can be sold, or can the factory produce and sell unlimited quantities of each product (subject only to machine capacity)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks a single clarification question regarding whether demand is limited or unlimited, which constitutes one independent semantic request."
}

{
  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "Since each product must go through both procedure A and procedure B, is the number of units of a product that go through procedure A required to equal the number that go through procedure B (i.e., every unit produced must be completed through both procedures, with no work-in-progress or leftover units)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking whether the flow balance between the two procedures is required, with no other independent requests."
}

{
  "action": "question",
